    "title": "Here's where to watch, celebrate FIFA World Cup matches across Seattle and Washington - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Will Wixey ,\n1 hours ago SEATTLE - Washingtonians won't have to travel far to catch all the excitement of the 2026 FIFA World Cup games this summer. A massive network of \"fan zones\" and \"fan celebration sites\" are planned across the Evergreen State for the global tournament, with big screen watch parties for multiple matches. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
